A monster will pick up any alignment-appropriate not-cursed
artifact and switch to wielding it immediately.  This can be
used to get an artifact that you want to wield away from your
pet.

Demonbane is lawful and if I read the tables correctly Aleax
at alignment 7 is lawful so he should pick it up immediately.

If the longsword he's wielding is cursed then it's welded to
his hands so he can't switch.  Pet's aren't supposed to pick
up or wield cursed weapons so that's only a possibility if
he was charmed not made from a blessed figurine.  Hmm,
Angels seem to come with blessed rustproof long swords
so that seems unlikely as well.  I think the only way to get
a pet Angel wielding a cursed long sword is to charm some
other type of monster wielding one then polymorph.  I'm
confident he'll pick up Demonbane ...



